\"name\":\"Blue Boy\",\"overview\":\"A recently released child molester is a suspect of a rape of an eleven year old girl.  G is in trouble at school.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1996-09-19\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Rules of Engagement\",\"overview\":\"Nina and McNamara work together on a case where two robbers are murdered.  Nina freezes in battle and decides to turn in her gun. G hangs out with young thieves.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1996-09-26\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Kill the Noise\",\"overview\":\"A war happens between east coast and west coast rappers when a california rapper is shot.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1996-10-31\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Smack Is Back\",\"overview\":\"Torres's father dies of a drug over dose and Torres believes that it was suicide.  Williams tries to get custody of G.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1996-11-07\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Don't Blink\",\"overview\":\"Nina's new undercover case questions her future as a cop.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1996-11-14\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Without Mercy\",\"overview\":\"Toress goes undercover at an AIDS clinic to solve a murder case of a bisexual man.  Cooper and Captain O'Bryne start to become closer.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1996-11-21\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Going Platinum\",\"overview\":\"Williams goes undercover as a security guard.  McNamara's discovers more of his father's case. Captain O'Bryne confesses his love for Cooper.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1996-12-05\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Brown Like Me\",\"overview\":\"Torres and Nina become involved with two feuding Latino gangs.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1996-12-19\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"The Reaper\",\"overview\":\"Lt. Cooper is taken hostage in her office by a man threatening to blow up the precinct if his son is not reprieved from a death-row sentence.  Nina learns that the daughter she gave up for adoption 11 years ago wants to meet her.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1997-01-09\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Fade Out\",\"overview\":\"A thirteen-year-old boy has a videotape of a murder.  Torres and Williams try to protect him; The boy's mother turns out to be Williams's old high-school girlfriend, whom he betrayed by sleeping with her best friend, Chantal.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1997-01-16\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"The Solomon Papers\",\"overview\":\"Feds may be part of a drug case and McNamara might lose it all to prove it.  Cooper and her husband tell their kids about their separation.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1997-01-30\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"School's Out\",\"overview\":\"Nina's daughter (whom she gave up for adoption) has been kidnapped and held for ransom.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1997-02-06\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Outrage\",\"overview\":\"The detectives have to prove that a Gulf War veteran has stolen missles.  Williams meets with G's french teacher about G's crush on her.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1997-02-13\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"The Promised Land\",\"overview\":\"Williams discover evidence relating to Martin Luther King Jr's murder.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1997-02-20\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Descell\",\"overview\":\"Nina and McNamara go undercover to find out who tried to kill an executive.  Williams and Natasha get close.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1997-03-13\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Hubris\",\"overview\":\"A female bounty hunter uses Williams to help find a fugitive in protective custody.  Nina and McNamara suspect a wife a recently deceased cop.  Natasha visits the precinct.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1997-03-27\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"The Unthinkable\",\"overview\":\"The detectives suspect a mother of being involved in a carjacking involving her two children.  Nina deals with her custody battle for Melissa.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1997-04-17\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Vendetta\",\"overview\":\"McNamara goes undercover involving a Chinese Mafia that has a link with his father's death.  Torres asks his sister for money to buy an engagement ring for Nina.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1997-04-24\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Is It a Crime?\",\"overview\":\"Williams investigate a case where a girl feel down and elevator shaft in her building.  Torres goes shopping for Nina's engagement ring.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1997-05-01\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"No Place Like Hell\",\"overview\":\"Willias go undercover at a prison to find evidence that will catch a drug lord.  William's new friend in prison becomes involved in a murder.  Torres purposes to Nina.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1997-05-08\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"The Last Hurrah\",\"overview\":\"The detectives go after a bank robbery ring. Torres and Nina get married.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"1997-05-15\",\"runtime\":44}],\"firstAirDate\":\"1994-09-08\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}